    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="s-knobs" data-code="knobs">
<div class="section-no">05 — Trade-off & γ Knob</div>
<h2>The Speculative Budget Knob</h2>
<p>The choice of draft length $\gamma$ represents a key trade-off in SimSD. A larger $\gamma$ increases the verification scope, yielding a higher realized acceptance rate and improved task accuracy. However, verifying more tokens increases sequence length, adding attention computation and KV cache management overhead.</p>

