<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Benchmark Results</div>
<h2>Throughput Acceleration</h2>
<p>In benchmarks on SDAR-family models across GSM8K, MBPP, TriviaQA, and MMLU, SimSD achieves significant acceleration. Because it requires no parameter modifications, SimSD is a plug-and-play addition that combines with other LLM serving improvements (such as CUDA Graphs and KV caching).</p>

<p>Overall, SimSD delivers up to **7.46x higher decoding throughput** than vanilla decoding with tensor parallelism (size 2), and consistently beats S2D2 self-speculation because it leverages a separate draft model to obtain high-quality proposals.</p>

